{"3770540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hexborn", "steam_appid": 3770540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770540/extras/49278d91b5fda3b39d40372c030e175f.avif?t=1783717469\" width=1074 height=675 /></span><br><br><br><br><strong>Hexborn</strong> is a dark fantasy action RPG that blends brutal hack-and-slash combat, deep dungeon crawling, guild progression, and player-driven rivalry in a world consumed by an ever-expanding corruption known as the Graveglass Blight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your path as one of the realm’s rising Scion — powerful adventurers gifted with unique, one-of-one abilities capable of shaping the fate of entire kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture alone or alongside allies into cursed ruins, forgotten catacombs, and hostile territories filled with ancient horrors, rival guilds, and lost secrets buried beneath the ashes of fallen civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the world decays, powerful Mystery Schools race to push magic beyond forbidden limits, unlocking dangerous new forms of sorcery while the Blight spreads without end. Decipher the truth behind Graveglass and uncover what lies at the center of its ceaseless expansion.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770540/extras/2936e81a66e586b37c84966bc7af2159.avif?t=1783717469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770540/extras_big/2936e81a66e586b37c84966bc7af2159.webp?t=1783717469 width=1560 height=878 /></span>Build your guild from a humble refuge into a dominant stronghold.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your reputation from a fledgling band of adventurers into a feared guild of elite mages, warriors, and relic hunters. Recruit allies, unlock new guild ranks, take on deadlier contracts, and expand your influence through large-scale raids, rare loot, and powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770540/extras/e444de203612de9d77685461a2aaa915.avif?t=1783717469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770540/extras_big/e444de203612de9d77685461a2aaa915.webp?t=1783717469 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather rare materials from dungeons, raids, and fallen bosses to craft weapons, relics, and artifacts that strengthen your guild. As your renown grows, unlock higher-tier recipes, empower your allies with legendary gear, and turn every hard-won resource into a lasting advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770540/extras/2320c374f3d6e0491390b2c549c20d7c.avif?t=1783717469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770540/extras_big/2320c374f3d6e0491390b2c549c20d7c.webp?t=1783717469 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring new companions into your guild as your reputation spreads across the realm. Each ally adds unique combat roles, abilities, and storylines, helping your guild take on tougher contracts, survive larger raids, and grow from a small band into a legendary force.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action hack-and-slash combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo play or cooperative multiplayer adventures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep dungeon crawling and loot-driven progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting systems for weapons, gear, and magical items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guild management and expanding home bases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raid rival guilds and defend your territory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive PvP arenas against other Scions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique character abilities that define your legacy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark fantasy world inspired by gothic and arcane horror</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Hexborn</strong>, power is earned, kingdoms fall, and legends are forged in the shadows.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770540/extras/49278d91b5fda3b39d40372c030e175f.avif?t=1783717469\" width=1074 height=675 /></span><br><br><br><br><strong>Hexborn</strong> is a dark fantasy action RPG that blends brutal hack-and-slash combat, deep dungeon crawling, guild progression, and player-driven rivalry in a world consumed by an ever-expanding corruption known as the Graveglass Blight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your path as one of the realm’s rising Scion — powerful adventurers gifted with unique, one-of-one abilities capable of shaping the fate of entire kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture alone or alongside allies into cursed ruins, forgotten catacombs, and hostile territories filled with ancient horrors, rival guilds, and lost secrets buried beneath the ashes of fallen civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the world decays, powerful Mystery Schools race to push magic beyond forbidden limits, unlocking dangerous new forms of sorcery while the Blight spreads without end. Decipher the truth behind Graveglass and uncover what lies at the center of its ceaseless expansion.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770540/extras/2936e81a66e586b37c84966bc7af2159.avif?t=1783717469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770540/extras_big/2936e81a66e586b37c84966bc7af2159.webp?t=1783717469 width=1560 height=878 /></span>Build your guild from a humble refuge into a dominant stronghold.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your reputation from a fledgling band of adventurers into a feared guild of elite mages, warriors, and relic hunters. Recruit allies, unlock new guild ranks, take on deadlier contracts, and expand your influence through large-scale raids, rare loot, and powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770540/extras/e444de203612de9d77685461a2aaa915.avif?t=1783717469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770540/extras_big/e444de203612de9d77685461a2aaa915.webp?t=1783717469 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather rare materials from dungeons, raids, and fallen bosses to craft weapons, relics, and artifacts that strengthen your guild. As your renown grows, unlock higher-tier recipes, empower your allies with legendary gear, and turn every hard-won resource into a lasting advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770540/extras/2320c374f3d6e0491390b2c549c20d7c.avif?t=1783717469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770540/extras_big/2320c374f3d6e0491390b2c549c20d7c.webp?t=1783717469 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring new companions into your guild as your reputation spreads across the realm. Each ally adds unique combat roles, abilities, and storylines, helping your guild take on tougher contracts, survive larger raids, and grow from a small band into a legendary force.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action hack-and-slash combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo play or cooperative multiplayer adventures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep dungeon crawling and loot-driven progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting systems for weapons, gear, and magical items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guild management and expanding home bases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raid rival guilds and defend your territory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive PvP arenas against other Scions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique character abilities that define your legacy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark fantasy world inspired by gothic and arcane horror</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Hexborn</strong>, power is earned, kingdoms fall, and legends are forged in the shadows.</p>", "short_description": "Hexborn is a dark fantasy action RPG where you rise from an unknown mage into the leader of a legendary guild. Master arcane combat, recruit powerful allies, forge relics, and descend into dangerous dungeons and large-scale raids to uncover the secrets behind your rare ability to fly.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770540/51487d64340873af3cf10970040da1a479aa5549/header.jpg?t=1783717469", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770540/897c1f26a8f6b4e4a5b9380f851465f1e0703df2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783717469", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_